opticsIMNsapAddress OBJECT-TYPE
    SYNTAX DisplayString
    MAX-ACCESS read-write
    STATUS current
    DESCRIPTION 
      "This scalar object defines the local NSAP address of
       the IP over CLNP tunnel"
