opticsIMCLNPTunnelEntry OBJECT-TYPE
    SYNTAX OpticsIMCLNPTunnelEntry
    MAX-ACCESS not-accessible
    STATUS current
    DESCRIPTION 
        "Each row describes a single far-end point of CLNP"
